- FashionModelCard
- LookSelector
- ActiveLookDetails
- LookProductList
- LookbookControls
- MobileLookCarousel

Use structured data to drive the appearance and behavior of the gallery.

Do not hardcode every look as a separate component.

Prefer FLIP-based layout animation or shared layout transitions where appropriate.

Use CSS transforms and opacity for smooth performance.

When transparent model cutouts are available, create a layered editorial stage.

When cutouts are not available, use beautifully cropped image panels with sophisticated transitions.

Do not attempt inaccurate background removal through CSS tricks.

Do not make true virtual try-on claims.

This feature is interactive fashion discovery, not body measurement or virtual fitting.

